   "ResonantChain_354_AttributesDescription": "Targets take {0} more Heavy Attack DMG from Jingran.\n<size=10></size>\nThe DMG Multiplier of <color=Highlight>Chimei Wangliang</color> is increased by {1}.\n<size=10></size>\nUpon entering the <color=Highlight><te href=121203>Yinghuo</te></color> state, Jingran gains the <color=Highlight>Parade of Thousand Souls</color> effect for {2}s. During this effect, if Jingran is the active Resonator in the team, upon dealing damage, Jingran summons <color=Highlight>Chimei Wangliang</color> to attack the targets, dealing <color=Fire>Fusion DMG</color>, considered Heavy Attack DMG.\n<size=10></size>\n<color=Highlight>Chimei Wangliang</color> can be summoned this way at an interval of {3}s for up to 8 times. <color=Highlight>Parade of Thousand Souls</color> ends and the available summon charges of <color=Highlight>Chimei Wangliang</color> reset when either of the following conditions is met:\n- Cast <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Burial of Thousand Souls</color>.\n- <color=Highlight><te href=121203>Yinghuo</te></color> ends or is removed.",
   "ResonantChain_354_NodeName": "As Favors and Feuds Fade, New Stories Await",
-  "ResonantChain_355_AttributesDescription": "Casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Formshift</color> grants Hsin 2 stacks of <color=Highlight>Radiance Ward</color>, stacking up to {0} times. Switching to <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color> clears all stacks. When Hsin takes DMG from an enemy target's attack, 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Radiance Ward</color> can be consumed to make Her immune to interruption and reduce DMG taken by {1} for {2}s. This effect can be triggered once every {3}s.\n\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>:\nThe DMG Multipliers of <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison</color> and <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison</color> are increased by {6}, and each stack of <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color> additionally increases the DMG Multipliers of <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison</color> and <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison</color> by {7}, up to a total {8} stacks.\n\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>:\nWhen Hsin enters combat, if <color=Highlight><te href=131113>Heart of Thunder</te></color> is below {13} stacks, it is increased to {13} stacks, triggered once every {12}s.\nThe DMG Multiplier of the <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> DMG triggered by <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Heartward by Moon</color> is increased to {16} x (the number of <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color> stacks on Hsin) x (the <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> DMG Multiplier corresponding to the target's current <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> stacks).",
