   "Skill_1006105_SkillName": "Gleaning Simple Joys",
   "Skill_1006105_SkillResume": "While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, <color=Highlight>Unison Boon</color> stacks on Resonators in the team are increased.\n\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>, for a certain time after Hsin casts <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color>, She inflicts <color=Highlight>Electro Flare</color> on targets within a certain range to the stack limit.",
   "Skill_1006106_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Answering Form</color></size>\nThis skill becomes available while in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>. Attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nAfter casting this skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 3</color> (when in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>) or <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 4</color> (when in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>).\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison</color></size>\nThis skill becomes available while in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>. Attack the target, dealing greater <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill DMG</color>.\nAfter casting this skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 3</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Illumining Form</color></size>\nThis skill becomes available while in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>. Attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison</color></size>\nThis skill becomes available while in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>. Attack the target, dealing greater <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill DMG</color>.",
   "Skill_1006106_SkillName": "Glance on a Whim",
   "Skill_1006106_SkillResume": "<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Enhanced Intro Skill</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, each time the <color=Highlight>Unison Response</color> is triggered, this <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> and the next become <color=Highlight>Enhanced Intro Skill</color>, dealing greater <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.",
-  "Skill_1006107_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Forms Born of Heart</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, Hsin can gain and consume <color=Highlight><te href=131117>Answering Heart</te></color>.\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, Hsin can gain and consume <color=Highlight><te href=131118>Illumining Heart</te></color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Wanderer</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, when Hsin's <color=Highlight><te href=131117>Answering Heart</te></color> reaches {0} points, <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Answering Form</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Wanderer</color>.\nHold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast the skill at the cost of STA and {0} points of <color=Highlight><te href=131117>Answering Heart</te></color>. Hsin is immune to interruption during the action, and deals <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color> to the target, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill DMG</color>.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Wanderer</color> grants Hsin <color=Highlight><te href=131114>Resolution of Wishes</te></color>. This <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Wanderer</color> consumes <color=Highlight><te href=131114>Resolution of Wishes</te></color> to become <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Protector</color>, dealing greater DMG. <color=Highlight><te href=131114>Resolution of Wishes</te></color> can only be gained once every {16}s.\nWhile casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Wanderer</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Protector</color>, if Hsin is not in the <color=Highlight><te href=131120>Heart Manifest</te></color> state, unlock <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Formshift</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, when Hsin's <color=Highlight><te href=131118>Illumining Heart</te></color> reaches 0 during the <color=Highlight><te href=131116>Mechanism Dominion</te></color> state, <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</color>.\nHold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast the skill at the cost of STA, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color> to the target, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill DMG</color>.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</color> grants Hsin <color=Highlight><te href=131115>Law of Heaven</te></color>. This <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</color> consumes <color=Highlight><te href=131115>Law of Heaven</te></color> to become <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Stilling All Horizons</color>, dealing greater DMG. <color=Highlight><te href=131115>Law of Heaven</te></color> can only be gained once every {16}s.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Stilling All Horizons</color> ends the <color=Highlight><te href=131116>Mechanism Dominion</te></color> state and unlocks <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Pillars Across Heaven</color>.\nCan be cast in mid-air.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, when Hsin's <color=Highlight><te href=131118>Illumining Heart</te></color> reaches {1} points and She is on the ground, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color>.\nWhen Hsin is on the ground, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> to deal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color> to surrounding targets, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill DMG</color>.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color> sends Hsin into the <color=Highlight><te href=131116>Mechanism Dominion</te></color> state.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Mechanism Dominion</color></size>\nThe <color=Highlight>Mechanism Dominion</color> state lasts {2}s.\nWhile this state is active, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color>, and <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color>.\nWhen <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color> or <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color> hits a target, <color=Highlight><te href=131118>Illumining Heart</te></color> is consumed if Hsin is the active Resonator.\nExiting <color=Highlight>Mechanism Dominion</color> clears <color=Highlight><te href=131118>Illumining Heart</te></color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Mode - Unison</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, Hsin gains the following effects:\n- Hsin can trigger <color=Highlight><te href=131112>Unison Response</te></color>, but not in Co-op Mode.\n- After casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form</color> or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison</color>, the next <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Formshift</color> grants Hsin <color=Highlight><te href=131110>Unison</te></color> for {17}s.\n- When Hsin triggers <color=Highlight><te href=131112>Unison Response</te></color>, She gains <color=Highlight>Source Intent</color>, and this cast of <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Manifold Unison</color>, dealing greater DMG.\nWhen Hsin casts an <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> without triggering <color=Highlight><te href=131112>Unison Response</te></color> while holding <color=Highlight>Source Intent</color>, She consumes <color=Highlight>Source Intent</color> instead, and the <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Manifold Unison</color>, dealing greater DMG.\n- The aforementioned effects are removed when Hsin switches Resonance Mode.\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form</color> or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison</color> sends Hsin directly into the <color=Highlight><te href=131116>Mechanism Dominion</te></color> state.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>, Hsin gains the following effects:\n- When Hsin enters combat, targets within a certain range do not lose <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> stacks when it's triggered.\n- After Resonators in the team inflict <color=Highlight><te href=150806>Electro Rage</te></color> to a target, every <SapTag=4>{4}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=4} of <color=Highlight><te href=150806>Electro Rage</te></color> inflicted grants Hsin <SapTag=6>{6}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=6} of <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color>, stacking up to {5} times, and consumes all <color=Highlight><te href=150806>Electro Rage</te></color> stacks from that target. <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color> is removed when Hsin switches Resonance Mode.\n- At the last stage of <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Heartward by Moon</color>, Hsin actively triggers 1 instance of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> DMG on the targets. Its DMG Multiplier is equal to {9} x (the number of <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color> stacks on Hsin) x (the <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> DMG Multiplier corresponding to the target's current <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> stacks).\nWhile casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Heartward by Moon</color>, switching to another Resonator or ending the skill early removes the above effects.\nSome time after casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Heartward by Moon</color>, Hsin consumes all remaining stacks of <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color>.\nWhen Hsin has at least {24} stacks of <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color>, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color> stagnates nearby targets during the action.\n- After casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Formshift</color>, inflict <SapTag=E>{18}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=E} of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> on nearby targets within a certain range. It also makes <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color> or <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color> inflict <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> on hit targets, up to <SapTag=A>{12}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=time P=times SapTag=A}. Casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Formshift</color> again resets this count. Switching Resonance Mode removes it.\n<color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color> and <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Stilling All Horizons</color> inflict <SapTag=E>{18}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=E} of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> on the target hit. <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form</color>, <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form</color>, and <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Protector</color> inflict <SapTag=F>{19}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=F} of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> on the target hit.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Unison</color></size>\nWhile Hsin is in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color> with <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, switching to another Resonator will remove Hsin's <color=Highlight>Unison</color> to trigger Hsin's Outro Skill and the incoming Resonator's Intro Skill. If Hsin has full Concerto Energy and <color=Highlight>Unison</color> at the same time, only <color=Highlight>Unison</color> is consumed to trigger the effect.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Unison Response</color></size>\nWhile Hsin is in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color> and the active Resonator in the team has <color=Highlight><te href=131110>Unison</te></color>, Hsin triggers <color=Highlight>Unison Response</color> after She is switched in and casts <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color>, granting <SapTag=G>{20}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=G} of <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color> to all Resonators in the team for {21}s.\nHsin can only grant up to <SapTag=G>{20}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=G} of <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color> in this way.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Unison Boon</color></size>\nOnly the Resonators who can trigger Unison Response can gain this effect. Each stack of <color=Highlight>Unison Boon</color> increases the total DMG dealt by Resonators who can trigger <color=Highlight><te href=131112>Unison Response</te></color> in the team by {22}, stacking up to {23} times.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Answering Heart</color></size>\nCan hold up to {0} points of <color=Highlight>Answering Heart</color>.\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, when <color=Highlight>Normal Attack - Answering Form</color>, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Answering Form</color>, <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form</color>, or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison</color> hits a target, Hsin gains <color=Highlight>Answering Heart</color> if She is the active Resonator.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form</color> or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison</color> grants {13} points of <color=Highlight>Answering Heart</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Illumining Heart</color></size>\nCan hold up to {1} points of <color=Highlight>Illumining Heart</color>.\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> and not in the <color=Highlight><te href=131116>Mechanism Dominion</te></color> state, when <color=Highlight>Normal Attack - Illumining Form</color>, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color>, or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form</color> hits a target, Hsin gains <color=Highlight>Illumining Heart</color> if She is the active Resonator.\n- While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form</color> or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison</color> directly sends Hsin into the <color=Highlight><te href=131116>Mechanism Dominion</te></color> state and grants {10} points of <color=Highlight>Illumining Heart</color>.\n- While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>, after casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Formshift</color>, when the <color=Highlight>Modular Heartlock</color> generated by <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 1</color> is collapsed by <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 2</color>, <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form</color>, <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form</color>, or <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color>, additionally gain {11} points of <color=Highlight>Illumining Heart</color> if Hsin is the active Resonator in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> but not in the <color=Highlight><te href=131116>Mechanism Dominion</te></color> state. This effect can only be triggered once before the next cast of <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Formshift</color> resets it, and is disabled when switched to the other Resonance Mode.",
