ighlight><te href=131112>Unison Response</te></color> while holding <color=Highlight>Source Intent</color>, She consumes <color=Highlight>Source Intent</color> instead, and the <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Manifold Unison</color>, dealing greater DMG.\n- The aforementioned effects are removed when Hsin switches Resonance Mode.\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form</color> or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison</color> sends Hsin directly into the <color=Highlight><te href=131116>Mechanism Dominion</te></color> state.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>, Hsin gains the following effects:\n- When Hsin enters combat, targets within a certain range do not lose <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> stacks when it's triggered.\n- After Resonators in the team inflict <color=Highlight><te href=150806>Electro Rage</te></color> on a target, every <SapTag=4>{4}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=4} of <color=Highlight><te href=150806>Electro Rage</te></color> inflicted grants Hsin <SapTag=6>{6}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=6} of <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color>, stacking up to {5} times, and consumes all <color=Highlight><te href=150806>Electro Rage</te></color> stacks from that target. <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color> is removed when Hsin switches Resonance Mode.\n- At the last stage of <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Heartward by Moon</color>, Hsin actively triggers 1 instance of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> DMG on the targets. Its DMG Multiplier is equal to {9} x (the number of <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color> stacks on Hsin) x (the <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> DMG Multiplier corresponding to the target's current <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> stacks).\nWhile casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Heartward by Moon</color>, switching to another Resonator or ending the skill early removes the above effects.\nSome time after casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Heartward by Moon</color>, Hsin consumes all remaining stacks of <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color>.\nWhen Hsin has at least {24} stacks of <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color>, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color> stagnates nearby targets during the action.\n- After casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Formshift</color>, inflict <SapTag=E>{18}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=E} of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> on nearby targets within a certain range. It also makes <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color> or <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color> inflict <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> on hit targets, up to <SapTag=A>{12}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=time P=times SapTag=A}. Casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Formshift</color> again resets this count. Switching Resonance Mode removes it.\n<color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color> and <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Stilling All Horizons</color> inflict <SapTag=E>{18}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=E} of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> on the target hit. <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form</color>, <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form</color>, and <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Protector</color> inflict <SapTag=F>{19}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=F} of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> on the target hit.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Unison</color></size>\nWhile Hsin is in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color> with <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, switching to another Resonator will remove Hsin's <color=Highlight>Unison</color> to trigger Hsin's Outro Skill and the incoming Resonator's Intro Skill. If Hsin has full Concerto Energy and <color=Highlight>Unison</color> at the same time, only <color=Highlight>Unison</color> is consumed to trigger the effect.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Unison Response</color></size>\nWhile Hsin is in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color> and the active Resonator in the team has <color=Highlight><te href=131110>Unison</te></color>, Hsin triggers <color=Highlight>Unison Response</color> after She is switched in and casts <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color>, granting <SapTag=G>{20}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=G} of <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color> to all Resonators in the team for {21}s.\nHsin can only grant up to <SapTag=G>{20}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=G} of <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color> in this way.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Unison Boon</color></size>\nOnly the Resonators who can trigger Unison Response can gain this effect. Each stack of <color=Highlight>Unison Boon</color> increases the total DMG dealt by Resonators who can trigger <color=Highlight><te href=131112>Unison Response</te></color> in the team by {22}, stacking up to {23} times.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Answering Heart</color></size>\nCan hold up to {0} points of <color=Highlight>Answering Heart</color>.\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, when <color=Highlight>Normal Attack - Answering Form</color>, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Answering Form</color>, <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form</color>, or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison</color> hits a target, Hsin gains <color=Highlight>Answering Heart</color> if She is the active Resonator.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form</color> or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison</color> grants {13} points of <color=Highlight>Answering Heart</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Illumining Heart</color></size>\nCan hold up to {1} points of <color=Highlight>Illumining Heart</color>.\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> and not in the <color=Highlight><te href=131116>Mechanism Dominion</te></color> state, when <color=Highlight>Normal Attack - Illumining Form</color>, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color>, or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form</color> hits a target, Hsin gains <color=Highlight>Illumining Heart</color> if She is the active Resonator.\n- While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form</color> or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison</color> directly sends Hsin into the <color=Highlight><te href=131116>Mechanism Dominion</te></color> state and grants {10} points of <color=Highlight>Illumining Heart</color>.\n- While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>, after casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Formshift</color>, when the <color=Highlight>Modular Heartlock</color> generated by <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 1</color> is collapsed by <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 2</color>, <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form</color>, <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form</color>, or <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color>, additionally gain {11} points of <color=Highlight>Illumining Heart</color> if Hsin is the active Resonator in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> but not in the <color=Highlight><te href=131116>Mechanism Dominion</te></color> state. This effect can only be triggered once before the next cast of <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Formshift</color> resets it, and is disabled when switched to the other Resonance Mode.",
